ze:14px;'>(<b>Personal Information</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#C2185B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Symptoms'>who presents for his annual examination.</span> <span style='color:#C2185B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Symptoms</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#689F38;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Reassessment'>Depression.\n- Medical Reasoning: He is doing well with his current regimen</span> <span style='color:#689F38; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Reassessment</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#689F38;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Assessment'>History of lobectomy.\n\u2022 Medical Reasoning: I do not think we need to do any more work up for this issue. He is able to exercise a lot and his breathing function is back. I do not think he needs to follow up with the surgeon anymore.</span> <span style='color:#689F38; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Assessment</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#689F38;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Reassessment'>Hypertension.\n\u2022 Medical Reasoning: He is doing well on his current regimen. His blood pressure was normal today and has been trending well over the past several years.</span> <span style='color:#689F38; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Reassessment</b>)</span></li></ol> <br/> </div>", "label_annotations": {"The annotated intent of the sentence is correct": {"No": "2"}}, "span_annotations": {}, "behavioral_data": {"time_string": "Time spent: 0d 0h 0m 2s "}}
