hy discussion with the patient in regards to his current symptoms</span> <span style='color:#C62828; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Discussion</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#D84315;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Acute Assessment'>His x-rays did not reveal any signs of a fracture</span> <span style='color:#D84315; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Assessment</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#9C27B0;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Discussion'>I would like to obtain an MRI of the lumbar spine to evaluate for a possible acute disc herniation.</span> <span style='color:#9C27B0; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Discussion</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#1E88E5;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Medications'> have prescribed the patient meloxicam 15 mg to treat his pain</span> <span style='color:#1E88E5; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Medications</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#F06292;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Medication'>He will continue with physical therapy </span> <span style='color:#F06292; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Medication</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#6A1B9A;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Referral'>and a referral was provided for this today.</span> <span style='color:#6A1B9A; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Referral</b>)</span></li></ol> <br/> </div>", "label_annotations": {"The annotated intent of the sentence is correct": {"No": "2"}}, "span_annotations": {}, "behavioral_data": {"time_string": "Time spent: 0d 0h 0m 40s "}}
