ve this is an ankle sprain.</span> <span style='color:#D84315; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Acute Assessment</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#689F38;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Reassessment'>2. Diabetes type 2.\n- Medical Reasoning: This appears to be well controlled with her current regimen.</span> <span style='color:#689F38; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Reassessment</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#689F38;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Reassessment'>3. Hypertension.</span> <span style='color:#689F38; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Reassessment</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#303F9F;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Theraputic History'>- Medical Reasoning: She is doing well with Norvasc.</span> <span style='color:#303F9F; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Theraputic History</b>)</span></li></ol> <br/> </div>", "label_annotations": {"The annotated intent of the sentence is correct": {"Yes": "1"}}, "span_annotations": {}, "behavioral_data": {"time_string": "Time spent: 0d 0h 0m 3s "}}
{"id": "prestudy_D2N042_1", "displayed_text": "<div name=\"instance_text\"> <legend> Intent </legend> <b>OBJECTIVE</b><br><span style='color:#00796B; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Physical Examination</span><span style='color:#5D4037; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Radiology Examination</span><span style='color:#F44336; font-size:15px; margin-right:10px;'>Lab Examination</span> <br/> </div><div name=\"instance_text\"> <legend> Note </legend> <ol><li><span style='color:#00796B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Physical Examination'>VITALS\n\nNormal</span> <span style='color:#00796B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Physical Examination</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#00796B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Physical Examination'>GAIT: antalgic gait</span> <span style='color:#00796B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Physical Examination</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#00796B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Physical Examination'>CV: Brisk capillary refill to less than 3 seconds. Strong dorsalis pedis pulse.</span> <span style='color:#00796B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Physical Examination</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#00796B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Physical Examination'>NEURO: Sensation in the right ankle is intact to light touch distally.</span> <span style='color:#00796B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Physical Examination</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#00796B;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Physical Examination'>MSK: Examination of the right ankle: Ecchymosis over the lateral malleolus associated with trace edema in that area. Tenderness to palpation over the anterolateral soft tissue. No laxity on anterior drawer testing or inversion stress testing. No bony tenderness on palpation of the foot or ankle area. Findings are consistent bilaterally.</span> <span style='color:#00796B; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Physical Examination</b>)</span></li><li><span style='color:#5D4037;' data-toggle='tooltip' data-html='true' title='Radiology Examination'>X-ray images of the right ankle were obtained and reviewed today. These reveal no evidence of fracture.</span> <span style='color:#5D4037; font-size:14px;'>(<b>Radiology Examination</b>)</span></li></ol> <br/> </div>", "label_annotations": {"The annotated intent of the sentence is correct": {"Yes": "1"}}, "span_annotations": {}, "behavioral_data": {"time_string": "Time spent: 0d 0h 0m 1s "}}
